Query assignment
----------------

src/equimo/vision/query_training/_assignment.py adapts the Hungarian algorithm
from Optax, licensed under Apache-2.0 (LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt).
Copyright 2024 DeepMind Technologies Limited. All Rights Reserved.
Source: https://github.com/google-deepmind/optax/blob/225a7079f4630bf75bee94ec78de9aa69c60fab3/optax/assignment/_hungarian_algorithm.py

Equimo contributors added target-slot validity, bounded loops, numerical-failure reporting,
fixed-capacity target-ordered outputs, explicit float32 arithmetic and stopped
gradients, and documented deterministic tie handling.

